# ====== Project-specific ======

# Built ingestion artifacts — historically gitignored per design.md §10.4
# ("rebuilt by `make ingest`"), but now COMMITTED because the deploy
# workflow's Docker build context needs them on the GitHub Actions
# runner. The bm25_index/ artifacts were already committed; we now also
# commit chroma_db/ and chunks.jsonl for consistency. Rebuilding still
# works locally via `make ingest`; the committed copies are the source
# of truth for production builds.
#
# These patterns are intentionally left commented as documentation:
#   chroma_db/
#   *.chroma
#   bm25.pkl
#   chunks.jsonl

# Local SQLite database (used by the local DocumentStore adapter).
local_data/
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# Eval run outputs (the inputs in eval/*.jsonl are committed; outputs are not).
eval/results/*.json
!eval/results/.gitkeep
eval/results/raw/

# Azure CLI / Terraform local state
.azure/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform/

# ====== NOT ignored (deliberately committed) ======
# data/                  <- raw corpus IS committed (acts at root + numbered judgment folders)
# sources.yaml           <- manifest IS committed
# AGENT.md, AGENT-frontend.md, design.md  <- planning docs ARE committedinfra/main.json

# Bicep build outputs (regenerated by `az bicep build`)
infra/main.json
infra/modules/*.json
infra/*.bicep.txt
infra/modules/*.bicep.txt
